flowchart TD
    U[User Goal / New Requirement] --> WB[AgentArbor Workbench]
    WB --> API[Application Server]
    API --> AK[Autonomy Kernel]

    subgraph CORE[AgentArbor Core]
        AK --> GM[Goal Manager]
        AK --> SO[State Observer]
        AK --> GA[Gap Analyzer]
        AK --> OG[Option Generator]
        AK --> DE[Decision Engine]
        AK --> RE[Reflection Engine]
        AK --> ED[Evolution Decider]
    end

    DE --> AO[Agent Organization]
    AO --> R[Root Orchestrator]
    R --> PL[Phase Lead Agents]
    PL --> W[Worker Agents]

    W --> ER[Execution Runtime]
    ER --> CF[Capability Fabric]
    CF --> MCP[MCP Connectors]
    CF --> SK[Skills]
    CF --> AG[.agent Manifests]
    CF --> PG[Plugins]
    CF --> BI[Built-in Tools]

    ER --> WS[Workspace]
    ER --> TEST[Test Runner]
    ER --> GIT[Git Engine]
    ER --> LOG[Event Bus]

    TEST --> VS[Verification System]
    VS --> RE
    RE --> ED
    ED --> EV[Evolution System]
    EV --> GIT

    GOV[Governance System] --> AK
    GOV --> ER
    GOV --> CF

    LOG --> API
    API --> WB
